      {
        "text": "TrigUp Managers & Staff Interview Results:",
        "list": false,
        "icons": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Repetitive Onboarding: Staff repeatedly deliver identical training modules and core instructions to every startup.",
        "list": true,
        "icons": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Fragmented Data Collection: Lack of integration and unified systems when receiving startup files and documentation.",
        "list": true,
        "icons": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Visibility Gaps: A clear need for a more precise, real-time method to track startup progress and growth trajectories.",
